Changes
-------
The SRD 5.2.1 content shipped with this project (the system content catalog —
e.g. the class definitions under
`apps/api/src/features/content/*/data/srd-cc-5.2.1/`) has been modified for use
here: it has been reshaped into this project's structured data model (Zod
contracts in `@rpg/contracts`), abbreviated, and adapted. Descriptions and
mechanics may be summarized and are not the complete SRD text.

Derivative content
------------------
Homebrew and patched content authored within the app that is derived from
SRD 5.2.1 material inherits the CC-BY-4.0 attribution obligations of the
original. Attribution must be preserved when such content is shared or
distributed.

